    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89940" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσπερονάω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περόνη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fasten</i> or
				<i>attach by means of a pin</i>: generally, <i>fasten
			on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυχὴν πρὸς τὸ σῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					83d
				</span></i>
			; <i>nail up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρκίνους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					2.8.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὴν στοήν Ἀρχ.
			Δελτ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				11.23
			</span></i> (Chios, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>):— 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτοι προσπεπερονημένοι πρὸς τοῖς
					κρέασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					7.3.21
				</span></i>
			.</div>
